In order to Vikas Kumar (Dar) vs Mohd. Sahid (17/19, Oia) on 20 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/168524186/
6 appreciate two concepts pecuniary damages may include expenses incurred by the claimant: (i) medical attendance; (ii) loss of earning of profit up to the date of trial;
(iii) other material loss.
